8. Full Deployment Steps
Step 1 — Install prerequisites


# Install MTA Build Tool globally
npm install -g mbt


# Install Cloud Foundry CLI + MTA plugin
cf install-plugin multiapps

Step 2 — Build


cd age-role-app
mbt build
# Output: mta_archives/age-role-app_1.0.0.mtar

Step 3 — Deploy


cf login -a https://api.cf.<region>.hana.ondemand.com
cf target -o <your-org> -s <your-space>
cf deploy mta_archives/age-role-app_1.0.0.mtar

Step 4 — Assign Role Collections in BTP Cockpit
Navigate to BTP Cockpit > Security > Users
Select User A > Assign Role Collection > "User1RoleCollection" (contains User1Role)
Select User B > Assign Role Collection > "User2RoleCollection" (contains User2Role)
Role Collections must be created first under Security > Role Collections

Step 5 — Verify


# Test as User A (User1Role) — expect only age > 40
curl -H "Authorization: Bearer <userA-token>" \
  https://<approuter-url>/personservice/Persons


# Test as User B (User2Role) — expect only age < 40
curl -H "Authorization: Bearer <userB-token>" \
  https://<approuter-url>/personservice/Persons

