🔒  Security Architecture Confirmation
All filtering is enforced server-side in the CAP srv/service.js handler. The Fiori UI sends a standard OData request and renders whatever the backend returns. No role information is exposed to or evaluated by the frontend. This design is secure: even if a user manipulates the browser, the CAP layer will still apply the correct WHERE clause based on the JWT scope.


